This sample will show how to use the compute/genGroupContexts.sh script to generate a pod template, launcher context, compute context and batch context per group (ie. department).

The scenario here is that every department has their own specific mount point that should be made available to their context, but they should not see other groups' mount points.

To use this sample:

- copy this directory to a work directory
- run the sas-viya-helpers/compute/genGroupContexts.sh -f <group file> -t <this working directory> -o <an output directory>
